{"type":"message","id":"1a125188","parentId":"dfe1fd37","timestamp":"2026-03-04T02:27:43.250Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"项目目录已存在，有需求文档。这是一个复杂任务，需要：\n1. 新架构设计\n2. 多个组件\n3. 不熟悉的技术（CRDT）\n4. 用户面向变化\n\n按照 AGENTS.md，这是 **Complex** 级别任务，需要：\n- search-agent: 研究 CRDT 技术细节\n- design-agent: 架构设计\n- code-agent: 实现\n- test-agent: 测试\n- review-agent: 审查\n- docs-agent: 文档\n\n工作流 DAG:\n```\nsearch-agent → design-agent → code-agent → test-agent → review-agent → docs-agent\n                                ↑              │\n                                └──────────────┘ (loop max 3x)\n```\n\n让我开始协调：\n1. 先创建协调计划文件\n2. Spawn search-agent 研究技术\n3. 同时或随后 spawn design-agent 设计架构\n4. 然后迭代 code → test → review\n\n首先创建项目目录结构和协调计划。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"项目目录已创建，需求文档完整。这是一个 **Complex** 级别任务，需要完整团队。\n\n## Phase 2: 计划 - DAG 设计与团队选择\n\n让我创建协调计划："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-43539eec970449eba75a3b7e06e7724d","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"mkdir -p /home/one/projects/PixelArtEditor/src/{crdt,editor,encoding} /home/one/projects/PixelArtEditor/tests /home/one/.openclaw-reports/leader-agent"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-36a320af13ac4f1cb80e3604d28796c7","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"# Coordination Plan\n\n**Date:** 2026-03-04\n**Task:** 开发协作像素编辑器 (Pixel Art Editor with CRDTs)\n**Agent:** leader-agent\n\n## Workspace\n`/home/one/projects/PixelArtEditor`\n\n## Complexity Assessment\n- **Level:** Complex\n- **Reasoning:** \n  - New architecture (CRDT-based)\n  - Multiple integrations (Canvas, Pointer Events, Binary Encoding)\n  - Unfamiliar technology (CRDTs)\n  - Significant user-facing features\n\n## Selected Team\n| Agent | Role | Workspace | Status |\n|-------|------|-----------|--------|\n| search-agent | Research CRDTs & reference articles | /home/one/projects/PixelArtEditor | ⏳ Pending |\n| design-agent | Architecture & interfaces | /home/one/projects/PixelArtEditor | ⏳ Pending |\n| code-agent | Core implementation | /home/one/projects/PixelArtEditor | ⏳ Pending |\n| test-agent | Unit tests & integration tests | /home/one/projects/PixelArtEditor | ⏳ Pending |\n| review-agent | Code review & quality | /home/one/projects/PixelArtEditor | ⏳ Pending |\n| docs-agent | Documentation | /home/one/projects/PixelArtEditor | ⏳ Pending |\n\n## Workflow DAG\n```\n┌──────────────┐\n│search-agent  │ (研究技术细节)\n└──────┬───────┘\n       │\n       ↓\n┌─────────────┐\n│design-agent │ (架构设计、接口定义)\n└──────┬──────┘\n       │\n       ↓\n┌─────────────┐     ┌─────────────┐     ┌──────────────┐\n│ code-agent  │ →   │ test-agent  │ →   │ review-agent │\n└──────┬──────┘     └─────────────┘     └──────┬───────┘\n       │                                        │\n       │           ❌ Issues found              │\n       └────────────────────────────────────────┘\n                    (loop max 3x)\n       \n       ✅ Approved → ┌──────────────┐\n                    │  docs-agent   │ → ✅ Done\n                    └──────────────┘\n```\n\n## Iteration Rules\n| Stage | Exit Criteria | Loop Back To | Max Iterations |\n|-------|---------------|--------------|----------------|\n| Search | Key concepts documented | - | 1 |\n| Design | Design approved by leader | - | 2 |\n| Code→Test→Review | All tests pass AND review approved | Code | 3 |\n\n## Exit Conditions\n- Loop exits when: All tests pass AND review approved\n- Escalate when: 3 iterations without progress\n\n## Development Phases\n1. **Phase 1: Core CRDTs** - LWWRegister, LWWMap, PixelData\n2. **Phase 2: Pixel Editor UI** - Canvas, Pointer Events, DDA\n3. **Phase 3: State Sync** - Network simulation, merge\n4. **Phase 4: Binary Encoding** - 98% compression\n5. **Phase 5: Testing & Polish** - Tests, benchmarks, docs\n\n## Status\n🔄 In Progress - Starting with search-agent","file_path":"/home/one/.openclaw-reports/leader-agent/2026-03-04-pixel-art-editor-plan.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"glm-5","us