{"type":"message","id":"287e501a","parentId":"7a00f28e","timestamp":"2026-03-04T02:43:28.182Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"这个解码器还是有问题。我需要重新考虑编码策略。问题在于我们需要正确处理空白像素。\n\n让我重新设计编码器，使其记录所有像素的位置。实际上，根据教程文章，run-length encoding 应该同时处理空白像素和彩色像素。\n\n让我重新审视文章中的方法...文章提到对于数据块，使用 tag 字节来区分 blank 和 pixel：\n- TAG_BLANK (0) + run length (2 bytes)\n- TAG_PIXEL (1) + writer ID (1 byte) + timestamp (1 byte) + color ID (1 byte)\n\n但我的实现使用了分离的 chunks，这样更简单。我需要确保解码器正确重建像素位置。\n\n最简单的方法是：\n1. 编码时记录所有像素（包括空白的）的位置\n2. 解码时按顺序重建\n\n但这样会失去压缩效果。\n\n另一个方法是使用 tag + run-length 的原始设计，让我重写编码器以匹配教程。让我重写编码器以正确处理空白像素：<tool_call>write<arg_key>content</arg_key><arg_value>import type { PixelDataState, RGB } from \"../types.js\";\n\n/**\n * Binary format constants\n */\nconst MAGIC = \"CRDT\"; // Magic number (4 bytes)\nconst CHUNK_INFO = \"INFO\"; // Info chunk identifier\nconst CHUNK_UUID = \"UUID\"; // UUID chunk identifier\nconst CHUNK_PLTT = \"PLTT\"; // Palette chunk identifier\nconst CHUNK_DATA = \"DATA\"; // Data chunk identifier\n\n/**\n * Data item types in run-length encoding\n */\nconst TAG_BLANK = 0; // Blank pixel (followed by run length)\nconst TAG_PIXEL = 1; // Colored pixel\n\n/**\n * Encoder - Converts PixelData state to binary format\n * Implements the 98% compression pipeline:\n * 1. UUID table deduplication\n * 2. Palette table deduplication  \n * 3. Run-length encoding\n * 4. Binary encoding\n */\nexport class Encoder {\n  #width: number;\n  #height: number;\n  #uuidTable: Map<string, number> = new Map();\n  #paletteTable: Map<string, number> = new Map();\n\n  constructor(width: number, height: number) {\n    this.#width = width;\n    this.#height = height;\n  }\n\n  /**\n   * Encode state to binary Uint8Array\n   */\n  encode(state: PixelDataState): Uint8Array {\n    // Build lookup tables\n    this.#buildTables(state);\n\n    const chunks: Uint8Array[] = [];\n\n    // Info chunk\n    chunks.push(this.#encodeInfoChunk());\n\n    // UUID chunk\n    chunks.push(this.#encodeUUIDChunk());\n\n    // Palette chunk (skip index 0 for erased pixels)\n    chunks.push(this.#encodePaletteChunk());\n\n    // Data chunk (run-length encoded)\n    chunks.push(this.#encodeDataChunk(state));\n\n    // Concatenate all chunks\n    const totalSize = chunks.reduce((sum, chunk) => sum + chunk.length, 0);\n    const result = new Uint8Array(totalSize);\n    let offset = 0;\n    for (const chunk of chunks) {\n      result.set(chunk, offset);\n      offset += chunk.length;\n    }\n\n    return result;\n  }\n\n  /**\n   * Build UUID and palette lookup tables from state\n   */\n  #buildTables(state: PixelDataState): void {\n    let uuidIndex = 0;\n    let paletteIndex = 1; // Start from 1, keep 0 for erased pixels\n\n    for (const key in state) {\n      const [peerId, , value] = state[key];\n\n      // Add to UUID table\n      if (!this.#uuidTable.has(peerId)) {\n        this.#uuidTable.set(peerId, uuidIndex++);\n      }\n\n      // Add to palette table (skip null/erased)\n      if (value) {\n        const hex = this.#rgbToHex(value);\n        if (!this.#paletteTable.has(hex)) {\n          this.#paletteTable.set(hex, paletteIndex++);\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  /**\n   * Encode INFO chunk: magic + width\n   */\n  #encodeInfoChunk(): Uint8Array {\n    const data = new Uint8Array(4 + 2); // 4 bytes magic + 2 bytes width\n    const view = new DataView(data.buffer);\n\n    // Magic number\n    data[0] = MAGIC.charCodeAt(0);\n    data[1] = MAGIC.charCodeAt(1);\n    data[2] = MAGIC.charCodeAt(2);\n    data[3] = MAGIC.charCodeAt(3);\n\n    // Width (big-endian uint16)\n    view.setUint16(4, this.#width);\n\n    return data;\n  }\n\n  /**\n   * Encode UUID chunk: header + UUIDs\n   */\n  #encodeUUIDChunk(): Uint8Array {\n    const uuids = Array.from(this.#uuidTable.entries())\n      .sort((a, b) => a[1] - b[1])\n      .map(([uuid]) => uuid);\n\n    // Remove hyphens from UUIDs (36 chars -> 32 chars)\n    const uuidData = new Uint8Array(uuids.length * 16);\n    for (let i = 0; i < uuids.length; i++) {\n      const clean = uuids[i].replace(/-/g, \"\");\n      for (let j = 0; j < 32; j += 2) {\n        const byte = parseInt(clean.substring(j, j + 2), 16);\n        uuidData[i * 16 + j / 2] = byte;\n      }\n    }\n\n    // Chunk: header (4 + 2) + data\n    const header = this.#encodeChunkHeader(CHUNK_UUID, uuidData.length);\n    const chunk = new Uint8Array(header.length + uuidData.length);\n    chunk.set(header, 0);\n    chunk.set(uuidData, header.length);\n\n    return chunk;\n  }\n\n  /**\n   * Encode palette chunk: header + colors (skip index 0)\n   */\n  #encodePaletteChunk(): Uint8Array {\n    const colors = Array.from(this.#paletteTable.entries())\n      .sort((a, b) => a[1] - b[1])\n      .map(([hex]) => this.#hexToRgb(hex));\n\n    // Skip index 0 by adding dummy bytes\n    const paletteData = new Uint8Array(3 + colors.length * 3);\n    paletteData[0] = 0; // Dummy R\n    paletteData[1] = 0; // Dummy G\n    paletteData[2] = 0; // Dummy B\n\n    for (let i = 0; i < colors.length; i++) {\n      const offset = 3 + i * 3;\n      paletteData[offset] = colors[i][0];\n      paletteData[offset + 1] = colors[i][1];\n      paletteData[offset + 2] = colors[i][2];\n    }\n\n    const header = this.#encodeChunkHeader(CHUNK_PLTT, paletteData","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"error","timestamp":1772592185566,"errorMessage":"terminated"}}
{"type":"message","id":"d712abe2","parentId":"287e501a","timestamp":"2026-03-04T02:44:29.334Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"等等，我需要重新思考这个解码逻辑。问题在于编码器没有正确记录空白像素的位置。让我重新查看编码器的逻辑，然后修复。\n\n实际上，在原始文章中，空白像素的处理方式不同。编码器应该记录：\n1. 哪些位置有像素\n2. 哪些位置是空白（以及连续的空白像素数量）\n\n但目前的编码器只是简单地记录非空白像素，丢失了位置信息。让我修复编码器来正确记录位置。我需要重新设计编码逻辑，使其能够正确追踪像素的位置和空白区域。具体来说，我将修改编码器，确保每个像素都被精确映射，同时保留空白区域的关键信息。这将需要更复杂的数据结构来跟踪画布的状态。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"让我修复编码器来正确处理空白像素的位置："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-9e290f27d26b4a19956986c75954d771","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"import type { PixelDataState, RGB } from \"../types.js\";\n\n/**\n * Binary format constants\n */\nconst MAGIC = \"CRDT\"; // Magic number (4 bytes)\nconst CHUNK_INFO = \"INFO\"; // Info chunk identifier\nconst CHUNK_UUID = \"UUID\"; // UUID chunk identifier\nconst CHUNK_PLTT = \"PLTT\"; // Palette chunk identifier\nconst CHUNK_DATA = \"DATA\"; // Data chunk identifier\n\n/**\n * Data item types in run-length encoding\n */\nconst TAG_BLANK = 0; // Blank pixel (followed by run length)\nconst TAG_PIXEL = 1; // Colored pixel\n\n/**\n * Encoder - Converts PixelData state to binary format\n * Implements the 98% compression pipeline:\n * 1. UUID table deduplication\n * 2. Palette table deduplication  \n * 3. Run-length encoding\n * 4. Binary encoding\n */\nexport class Encoder {\n  #width: number;\n  #height: number;\n  #uuidTable: Map<string, number> = new Map();\n  #paletteTable: Map<string, number> = new Map();\n\n  constructor(width: number, height: number) {\n    this.#width = width;\n    this.#height = height;\n  }\n\n  /**\n   * Encode state to binary Uint8Array\n   */\n  encode(state: PixelDataState): Uint8Array {\n    // Build lookup tables\n    this.#buildTables(state);\n\n    const chunks: Uint8Array[] = [];\n\n    // Info chunk\n    chunks.push(this.#encodeInfoChunk());\n\n    // UUID chunk\n    chunks.push(this.#encodeUUIDChunk());\n\n    // Palette chunk (skip index 0 for erased pixels)\n    chunks.push(this.#encodePaletteChunk());\n\n    // Data chunk (run-length encoded)\n    chunks.push(this.#encodeDataChunk(state));\n\n    // Concatenate all chunks\n    const totalSize = chunks.reduce((sum, chunk) => sum + chunk.length, 0);\n    const result = new Uint8Array(totalSize);\n    let offset = 0;\n    for (const chunk of chunks) {\n      result.set(chunk, offset);\n      offset += chunk.length;\n    }\n\n    return result;\n  }\n\n  /**\n   * Build UUID and palette lookup tables from state\n   */\n  #buildTables(state: PixelDataState): void {\n    let uuidIndex = 0;\n    let paletteIndex = 0; // Start from 1, keep 0 for erased pixels\n\n    for (const key in state) {\n      const [peerId, , value] = state[key];\n\n      // Add to UUID table\n      if (!this.#uuidTable.has(peerId)) {\n        this.#uuidTable.set(peerId, uuidIndex++);\n      }\n\n      // Add to palette table (skip null/erased)\n      if (value) {\n        const hex = this.#rgbToHex(value);\n        if (!this.#paletteTable.has(hex)) {\n          this.#paletteTable.set(hex, paletteIndex++);\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  /**\n   * Encode INFO chunk: magic + width\n   */\n  #encodeInfoChunk(): Uint8Array {\n    const data = new Uint8Array(4 + 2 + 2); // 4 bytes magic + 2 bytes width + 2 bytes height\n    const view = new DataView(data.buffer);\n\n    // Magic number\n    data[0] = MAGIC.charCodeAt(0);\n    data[1] = MAGIC.charCodeAt(1);\n    data[2] = MAGIC.charCodeAt(2);\n    data[3] = MAGIC.charCodeAt(3);\n\n    // Width and height (big-endian uint16)\n    view.setUint16(4, this.#width);\n    view.setUint16(6, this.#height);\n\n    return data;\n  }\n\n  /**\n   * Encode UUID chunk: header + UUIDs\n   */\n  #encodeUUIDChunk(): Uint8Array {\n    const uuids = Array.from(this.#uuidTable.entries())\n      .sort((a, b) => a[1] - b[1])\n      .map(([uuid]) => uuid);\n\n    // Remove hyphens from UUIDs (36 chars -> 32 chars)\n    const uuidData = new Uint8Array(uuids.length * 16);\n    for (let i = 0; i < uuids.length; i++) {\n      const clean = uuids[i].replace(/-/g, \"\");\n      for (let j = 0; j < 32; j += 2) {\n        const byte = parseInt(clean.substring(j, j + 2), 16);\n        uuidData[i * 16 + j / 2] = byte;\n      }\n    }\n\n    // Chunk: header (4 + 2) + data\n    const header = this.#encodeChunkHeader(CHUNK_UUID, uuidData.length);\n    const chunk = new Uint8Array(header.length + uuidData.length);\n    chunk.set(header, 0);\n    chunk.set(uuidData, header.length);\n\n    return chunk;\n  }\n\n  /**\n   * Encode palette chunk: header + colors (skip index 0)\n   */\n  #encodePaletteChunk(): Uint8Array {\n    const colors = Array.from(this.#paletteTable.entries())\n      .sort((a, b) => a[1] - b[1])\n      .map(([hex]) => this.#hexToRgb(hex));\n\n    // Skip index 0 by adding dummy bytes\n    const paletteData = new Uint8Array(3 + colors.length * 3);\n    paletteData[0] = 0; // Dummy R\n    paletteData[1] = 0; // Dummy G\n    paletteData[2] = 0; // Dummy B\n\n    for (let i = 0; i < colors.length; i++) {\n      const offset = 3 + i * 3;\n      paletteData[offset] = colors[i][0];\n      paletteData[offset + 1] = colors[i][1];\n      paletteData[offset + 2] = colors[i][2];\n    }\n\n    const header = this.#encodeChunkHeader(CHUNK_PLTT, paletteData.length);\n    const chunk = new Uint8Array(header.length + paletteData.length);\n    chunk.set(header, 0);\n    chunk.set(paletteData, header.length);\n\n    return chunk;\n  }\n\n  /**\n   * Encode data chunk with run-length encoding\n   */\n  #encodeDataChunk(state: PixelDataState): Uint8Array {\n    const data: number[] = [];\n\n    let x = 0;\n    let y = 0;\n\n    // Iterate through all pixels in row-major order\n    while (y < this.#height) {\n      const key = `${x},${y}`;\n      const pixel = state[key];\n\n      if (!pixel) {\n        // Blank pixel - count consecutive blanks\n        let blankCount = 0;\n        while (y < this.#height && !state[`${x},${y}`]) {\n          blankCount++;\n          x++;\n          if (x >= this.#width) {\n            x = 0;\n            y++;\n          }\n        }\n\n        // Write blank run (max 65535 blanks per run)\n        while (blankCount > 0) {\n          const count = Math.min(blankCount, 65535);\n          data.push(TAG_BLANK);\n          data.push((count >> 8) & 0xff);\n          data.push(count & 0xff);\n          blankCount -= count;\n        }\n      } else {\n        // Non-blank pixel\n        const [peerId, timestamp, value] = pixel;\n        const writerId = this.#uuidTable.get(peerId)!;\n        const colorId = value\n          ? this.#paletteTable.get(this.#rgbToHex(value))!\n          : 0;\n\n        data.push(TAG_PIXEL);\n        data.push(writerId);\n        data.push(timestamp);\n        data.push(colorId);\n\n        x++;\n        if (x >= this.#width) {\n          x = 0;\n          y++;\n        }\n      }\n    }\n\n    const dataArray = new Uint8Array(data);\n    const header = this.#encodeChunkHeader(CHUNK_DATA, dataArray.length);\n    const chunk = new Uint8Array(header.length + dataArray.length);\n    chunk.set(header, 0);\n    chunk.set(dataArray, header.length);\n\n    return chunk;\n  }\n\n  /**\n   * Encode chunk header: 4-byte identifier + 2-byte length\n   */\n  #encodeChunkHeader(id: string, length: number): Uint8Array {\n    const header = new Uint8Array(6);\n    const view = new DataView(header.buffer);\n\n    header[0] = id.charCodeAt(0);\n    header[1] = id.charCodeAt(1);\n    header[2] = id.charCodeAt(2);\n    header[3] = id.charCodeAt(3);\n    view.setUint16(4, length);\n\n    return header;\n  }\n\n  /**\n   * Convert RGB to hex string\n   */\n  #rgbToHex(rgb: RGB): string {\n    return (\n      ((rgb[0] << 16) | (rgb[1] << 8) | rgb[2])\n        .toString(16)\n        .padStart(6, \"0\")\n    );\n  }\n\n  /**\n   * Convert hex string to RGB\n   */\n  #hexToRgb(hex: string): RGB {\n    const num = parseInt(hex, 16);\n    return [(num >> 16) & 0xff, (num >> 8) & 0xff, num & 0xff];\n  }\n}","path":"/home/one/projects/PixelArtEditor/src/encoding/Encoder.ts"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-d12e417b1c32496ab8ab419a3f31e219","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"import type { PixelDataState, RGB } from \"../types.js\";\n\n/**\n * Decoder - Converts binary format to PixelData state\n */\nexport class Decoder {\n  #width = 0;\n  #height = 0;\n  #uuidTable: string[] = [];\n  #paletteTable: RGB[] = [];\n\n  /**\n   * Decode binary data to state\n   */\n  decode(data: Uint8Array): { state: PixelDataState; width: number; height: number } {\n    let offset = 0;\n\n    // Read magic number\n    const magic = String.fromCharCode(\n      data[offset],\n      data[offset + 1],\n      data[offset + 2],\n      data[offset + 3]\n    );\n    if (magic !== \"CRDT\") {\n      throw new Error(\"Invalid magic number\");\n    }\n    offset += 4;\n\n    // Read width and height\n    const view = new DataView(data.buffer);\n    this.#width = view.getUint16(offset);\n    this.#height = view.getUint16(offset + 2);\n    offset += 4;\n\n    // Read chunks\n    while (offset < data.length) {\n      const chunkId = String.fromCharCode(\n        data[offset],\n        data[offset + 1],\n        data[offset + 2],\n        data[offset + 3]\n      );\n      const chunkLength = view.getUint16(offset + 4);\n      offset += 6;\n\n      const chunkData = data.slice(offset, offset + chunkLength);\n      offset += chunkLength;\n\n      switch (chunkId) {\n        case \"UUID\":\n          this.#decodeUUIDChunk(chunkData);\n          break;\n        case \"PLTT\":\n          this.#decodePaletteChunk(chunkData);\n          break;\n        case \"DATA\":\n          return {\n            state: this.#decodeDataChunk(chunkData),\n            width: this.#width,\n            height: this.#height,\n          };\n        default:\n          throw new Error(`Unknown chunk: ${chunkId}`);\n      }\n    }\n\n    throw new Error(\"Missing DATA chunk\");\n  }\n\n  /**\n   * Decode UUID chunk\n   */\n  #decodeUUIDChunk(data: Uint8Array): void {\n    const uuidCount = data.length / 16;\n    this.#uuidTable = [];\n\n    for (let i = 0; i < uuidCount; i++) {\n      const offset = i * 16;\n      let hex = \"\";\n      for (let j = 0; j < 16; j++) {\n        hex += data[offset + j].toString(16).padStart(2, \"0\");\n      }\n      // Add hyphens back\n      const uuid = [\n        hex.substring(0, 8),\n        hex.substring(8, 12),\n        hex.substring(12, 16),\n        hex.substring(16, 20),\n        hex.substring(20),\n      ].join(\"-\");\n      this.#uuidTable.push(uuid);\n    }\n  }\n\n  /**\n   * Decode palette chunk\n   */\n  #decodePaletteChunk(data: Uint8Array): void {\n    const colorCount = data.length / 3;\n    this.#paletteTable = [];\n\n    for (let i = 0; i < colorCount; i++) {\n      const offset = i * 3;\n      this.#paletteTable.push([\n        data[offset],\n        data[offset + 1],\n        data[offset + 2],\n      ]);\n    }\n  }\n\n  /**\n   * Decode data chunk\n   */\n  #decodeDataChunk(data: Uint8Array): PixelDataState {\n    const state: PixelDataState = {};\n    let offset = 0;\n    let x = 0;\n    let y = 0;\n    const view = new DataView(data.buffer);\n\n    while (y < this.#height && offset < data.length) {\n      const tag = data[offset];\n\n      if (tag === TAG_BLANK) {\n        // Blank run\n        const count = view.getUint16(offset + 1);\n        offset += 3;\n\n        // Skip blank pixels\n        for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {\n          x++;\n          if (x >= this.#width) {\n            x = 0;\n            y++;\n          }\n        }\n      } else if (tag === TAG_PIXEL) {\n        // Pixel\n        const writerId = data[offset + 1];\n        const timestamp = data[offset + 2];\n        const colorId = data[offset + 3];\n        offset += 4;\n\n        const key = `${x},${y}`;\n        const peerId = this.#uuidTable[writerId];\n        const color = colorId === 0 ? null : this.#paletteTable[colorId];\n\n        state[key] = [peerId, timestamp, color];\n\n        x++;\n        if (x >= this.#width) {\n          x = 0;\n          y++;\n        }\n      } else {\n        throw new Error(`Invalid tag: ${tag}`);\n      }\n    }\n\n    return state;\n  }\n\n  /**\n   * Set height (deprecated, now read from INFO chunk)\n   */\n  setHeight(height: number): void {\n    this.#height = height;\n  }\n}\n\n/**\n * Data item types in run-length encoding\n */\nconst TAG_BLANK = 0;\nconst TAG_PIXEL = 1;","path":"/home/one/projects/PixelArtEditor/src/encoding/Decoder.ts"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":69,"output":3426,"cacheRead":59711,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":63206,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772592210200}}
